sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Manager as odh-model-controller<br/>Controller Manager
    participant API as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant GW as Gateway API<br/>Resources
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant<br/>AuthPolicies
    participant Istio as Istio<br/>EnvoyFilters
    participant Prom as Prometheus Operator<br/>Monitors
    participant OTel as OpenTelemetry Collector<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over User,OTel: InferenceService Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated InferenceService
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-serving-kserve-io-v1beta1-inferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result
    K8sAPI-->>User: InferenceService created

    K8sAPI->>Manager: Watch event: InferenceService created<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Route<br/>route.openshift.io/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Service<br/>v1/Service
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceAccount<br/>v1/ServiceAccount
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update NetworkPolicy<br/>networking.k8s.io/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitor<br/>monitoring.coreos.com/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PodMonitor<br/>monitoring.coreos.com/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ClusterRoleBinding<br/>rbac.authorization.k8s.io/v1

    Manager->>OTel: Export reconciliation traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    Note over User,OTel: LLMInferenceService Creation Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply LLMInferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-serving-kserve-io-v1alpha2-llminferenceservice<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated LLMInferenceService

    K8sAPI->>Manager: Watch event: LLMInferenceService created
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Gateway<br/>gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoute<br/>gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AuthPolicy<br/>kuadrant.io/v1
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update EnvoyFilter<br/>networking/v1alpha3

    Note over User,OTel: NIM Account Flow (conditional: NIM_STATE=managed)

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply Account CR<br/>nim.opendatahub.io/v1
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-nim-opendatahub-io-v1-account<br/>TLS, Kubernetes admission
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Validation result

    K8sAPI->>Manager: Watch event: Account created
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ConfigMap<br/>NIM configuration
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Secret<br/>NIM credentials
    Manager->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Template<br/>template.openshift.io/v1

    Note over User,OTel: Gateway API Discovery (model-serving-api)

    User->>API: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    API->>K8sAPI: List Gateways<br/>gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1
    K8sAPI-->>API: Gateway list
    API-->>User: Gateway discovery response

    Note over User,OTel: Health & Metrics

    User->>API: GET /healthz<br/>8443/TCP
    API-->>User: 200 OK
    Prom->>Manager: GET /metrics<br/>8080/TCP
    Manager-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
